# HEARD Research & Launch Strategy

**Applied research and strategy documentation for HEARD: A platform connecting isolated individuals with trained peer listeners from underemployed populations.**

`Status: Active Research & Launch Planning` · `Phase: Pre-Launch` · `Focus: Loneliness, Disability Employment, Social Connection`

> **Repository:** Evidence base, research findings, LinkedIn launch strategy, and implementation guides for HEARD  
> **Related Application:** [heard-backup](https://github.com/Taha-Mahmoodi/heard-backup) — The HEARD platform codebase

