## 4-Week Posting Calendar

| Week | Theme | Tuesday | Wednesday | Thursday |
|------|-------|---------|-----------|----------|
| **1** | Awareness & origin | Post 1 (founder story) | Post 2 (loneliness epidemic) | Post 3 (blind employment) |
| **2** | The offer | Post 4 (call for listeners) | Post 5 (for those who need to talk) | Post 6 (science of being heard) |
| **3** | Who we serve | Post 7 (elderly) | Post 8 (refugees) | Post 9 (reframing work) |
| **4** | Momentum | Post 10 (follow & share) | Post 11 (founder reflection) | Reshare best-performing post |

**Sequencing logic:**
- Week 1: Establish founder and "why"
- Week 2: Make the two core asks (be a listener / use HEARD)
- Week 3: Humanize each population served
- Week 4: Convert attention into follows and shares, loop high performers back

